    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 About the Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychedelic Dream is a surreal exploration game inspired by LSD: Dream Emulator and Yume Nikki, where every door you enter leads to a randomly selected dream based on real, personal dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some dreams are beautiful and peaceful, others strange, abstract, or nightmarish. The experience blends light platforming, puzzle solving, and walking simulator elements, encouraging exploration and curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dream world is handcrafted with unique environments, characters, and moods \u2014 ranging from whimsical and funny to eerie and unsettling. Meet bizarre creatures, uncover hidden dreamscapes, and lose yourself in the unpredictable nature of the subconscious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecf\ufe0f How many dreams can you find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random dream loading each time you enter a door</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of dream worlds: cozy, surreal, creepy, or downright weird</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming and puzzle-solving elements mixed with atmospheric exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wacky and strange characters to meet in every corner of the dreamscape</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A growing world: more dreams will be added over time through regular updates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcad Send Us Your Dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to be part of the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your own dream to the support mail \u2014 include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your name (or nickname)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A title for your dream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A detailed description of what you saw or felt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dream might be selected and turned into a playable level in a future update!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
