_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcad Send Us Your Dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to be part of the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your own dream to the support mail \u2014 include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your name (or nickname)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A title for your dream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A detailed description of what you saw or felt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dream might be selected and turned into a playable level in a future update!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
